        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Describe the page and the picture you need in **Hero Brief**.\n3. Press **Run**. The best of four images is saved under `hero/approved` or `hero/review`."
